{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "ServerFact",
  "description": "Every message the server sends to a client over the WebSocket connection,\nwrapped by `ServerMessage::Fact` and postcard-encoded (ADR-0042).\n\nThis enum is the schema-of-record for the server -> client half of the\nwire protocol: [`server_fact_json_schema()`] renders it to a JSON Schema\ndocument that `docs/architecture/wire-protocol.md` is generated from.\nAdding, removing, or renaming a field here changes the wire format for\nevery client (Godot today; any future client written against\n`docs/architecture/wire-protocol.md`).\n\nExternally tagged (serde's default enum representation), not\n`#[serde(tag = \"type\")]` -- `postcard` cannot deserialize an internally\ntagged enum (no `deserialize_any`). `dawn-client-gdext` decodes this\nenum into a typed client outcome and performs all variant dispatch in\nRust; GDScript never reconstructs this enum from a string tag.\n\n`Deserialize` (ADR-0042) exists so `dawn-client-gdext` can decode a\n`ServerMessage` it receives; the server itself only ever serializes this\ntype, never parses it back.",
  "oneOf": [
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "ShipSpawned": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "position": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/AbsPosWire"
            },
            "ship_id": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "uint64",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "tick": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "uint64",
              "minimum": 0
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "ship_id",
            "position",
            "tick"
          ]
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "ShipSpawned"
      ]
    },
    {
